            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sabrina Julien-Budhram"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It is just right... great recipe especially as a base to make it your own. I added grated cocoa, caramel sauce and some whip cream with chocolate sprinkles on top and banana to garnish and voila... the perfect milkshake was made! My hubby went crazy for it. Thank you for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-17T19:30:12.283Z"
          },
          {
