            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "reddawgz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Didn't have a chocolate drink mix, only hot cocoa mix with cinnamon so used that...worked well. Otherwise made to recipe. If I made again would use either more ice cream or less milk...would prefer it a bit thicker and skip the chocolate(but keep the cinnamon). Sorry, I'm not a big chocolate freak.",
            "datePublished": "2025-03-19T00:28:33.483Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kittyhawk5079"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe in the middle of winter because I wanted something cold to drink. It was the best milkshake recipe by far! Because I didn't like the idea of chocolate and banana, I eliminated the chocolate, and it was spectacular by itself. I also added 6 ice cubes to make it colder and thicker. Everyone in my family loved it and wanted seconds :)",
            "datePublished": "2014-03-03T12:25:22.940Z"
          },
          {
