            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "House of Aqua"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This milkshake has a great balance of milk to ice cream and I like the half of a banana so it doesn't become too overpowering. I used Carnation regular malted milk powder instead of Ovaltine, but I added 1 Tablespoon Dutch Pressed Cocoa Powder. I topped mine with homemade whipped cream.",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-17T16:46:11.217Z"
          },
